[9250]=[=[{o="Find someone that will help you in recovering the last two pieces of the staff and ridding it of evil.",d="With the frame formed, Atiesh is nearly whole. Only the head and base of the staff are now missing. There is also a minor issue regarding the staff being a conduit for Sargeras's evil.\n\nFind someone that can assist you in locating the remaining pieces and exorcising the evil from the staff.",p="It was her time, mortal.",c="The archmages have died.\n\nDo not mourn their passing, <name>. All such things are fated. Just as you holding the staff of the Guardian was fated...",k=true}]=],
[9251]=[=[{o="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants the Staff Head of Atiesh and the Base of Atiesh.",d="You question why you are still alive. After all, you have in your possession an item of great evil. The answer is not clear, <name>. I only do as I must.\n\nKel'Thuzad sits atop his throne in Naxxramas, plotting... He seeks that which you hold and holds that which you seek.\n\nAs for the base of the staff; the dwarf, Brann Bronzebeard, held it when he entered Ahn'Qiraj. He has left Ahn'Qiraj but the base of Atiesh remains.\n\nShould you succeed in recovering the pieces, return them to me.",p="In its current form, the staff is far too dangerous to be in the hands of a mortal.",c="There is a being within... a being not of this world.",k=true}]=],
[9257]=[=[{o="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",d="This final task will be the most difficult of all, <name>. You have faced and defeated both an Old God and the Lich King's General, but now you must face the hand of Sargeras.\n\nTake the staff to Stratholme. It is there that you will find a piece of consecrated earth: ground where the greatest knights of Lordaeron were murdered. Place the befouled staff upon the holy ground and prepare for an entity of immense power to break from within... Defeat the demonic being that controls the staff and return to me.",r={it={{22631,1,"Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",5,"inv_staff_medivh"}},rep={{910,500},{529,500}}},k=true}]=],
[9269]=[=[{o="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",d="This final task will be the most difficult of all, <name>. You have faced and defeated both an Old God and the Lich King's General, but now you must face the hand of Sargeras.\n\nTake the staff to Stratholme. It is there that you will find a piece of consecrated earth: ground where the greatest knights of Lordaeron were murdered. Place the befouled staff upon the holy ground and prepare for an entity of immense power to break from within... Defeat the demonic being that controls the staff and return to me.",r={it={{22632,1,"Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",5,"inv_staff_medivh"}}},k=true}]=],
